MiniChicken for Typora
Copyright (c) 2026 thiago-tadeu-goulart

This theme keeps the typography, layout and CSS structure of Typora's
built-in Night theme, and applies color values from the Gruvbox Light
palette together with MiniChicken-specific adjustments (including the
highlight color).

